#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md:1
msgid "Arabic Parts (Hermetic Lots)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md:3
msgid ""
"Arabic Parts — also called **Hermetic Lots** in classical astrology — are"
" sensitive points derived from the longitudes of chart positions rather "
"than from direct planetary observation. They were extensively used in "
"Hellenistic and Medieval astrology and remain central to traditional "
"practice."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md:5
msgid "Ketu provides a sect-aware registry of parts via the `ketu.parts` module."
msgstr ""

