msgid ""
"**Fortune and Spirit invert their formulas by sect:** in a day chart the "
"standard formula applies; in a night chart the formula is reversed (Sun "
"and Moon swap roles). Marriage is the same formula regardless of sect."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md:19
msgid "Sect Detection"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md:21
msgid ""
"`ketu.parts` uses `is_day_chart` from `ketu.charts` internally. The chart"
" passed to `calculate_part` carries its own `jd`, `lat`, and `lon` — Ketu"
" determines sect automatically from those values."
msgstr ""

